The first test run of the day failed three tests because the local `dist` was built from an older branch (version 3.0.0). After `npm run build` they passed. The committed bundles matched a fresh build.

## Implementation review findings

The stage-1 roadmap note said this work was uncommitted on `feat/implementation-review-research`. It is not. It was committed there and merged into `release/v3.1.0` as #155 (findings, provenance, diagram text alternatives) and #156 (faster agent views). So every row is **source and tests, not released**, and none has study evidence.

|ID|Source|Tests|Adverse case tested|Released|Not covered|
|-|-|-|-|-|-|
